  "notes": "USAGE:\n- {指図|さしず}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to give orders, to direct)\n- {指図|さしず}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{受|う}ける→受ける：01215_ukeru⟧ (to receive orders)\n- ⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{指図|さしず}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧な (don't boss people around)\nOften carries a negative connotation of being bossy or authoritarian. Used when someone is giving commands in an overbearing manner.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{指示|しじ}→指示：09674_shiji⟧ - instructions (neutral, professional)\n- ⟦{命令|めいれい}→命令：03754_meirei⟧ - order, command (stronger, more formal)\n- {指図|さしず} - instructions (can imply bossiness)",
